{"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lineDetail","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLineDetail","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLLineDetailV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"lineDetail","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL15MXLStaffDetailsV5GroupV10lineDetailSayAA07MXLLineG0VGvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstaffdetails\/group-swift.struct\/linedetail"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies the appearance of each line individually, when present."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffDetails","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffDetails\/Group-swift.struct"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffDetails\/Group-swift.struct\/lineDetail","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lineDetail","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail","text":"MXLLineDetail","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLLineDetailV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to nested MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<line-detail>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" elements.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStaffDetails":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffDetails","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLStaffDetails","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLStaffDetails","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The staff-details element is used to indicate different types of staves. The optional number attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specifies the staff number from top to bottom on the system, as with clef. The print-object attribute is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to indicate when a staff is not printed in a part, usually in large scores where empty parts are omitted. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is yes by default. If print-spacing is yes while print-object is no, the score is printed in cutaway format"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where vertical space is left for the empty part."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstaffdetails","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffDetails","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStaffDetails/Group-swift.struct/lineDetail":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lineDetail","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLineDetail","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLLineDetailV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"title":"lineDetail","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Specifies the appearance of each line individually, when present."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstaffdetails\/group-swift.struct\/linedetail","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffDetails\/Group-swift.struct\/lineDetail","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLLineDetail":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLLineDetail","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLLineDetail","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLLineDetail","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If the staff-lines element is present, the appearance of each line may be individually specified with a line-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"detail type. Staff lines are numbered from bottom to top. The print-object attribute allows lines to be hidden"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within a staff. This is used in special situations such as a widely-spaced percussion staff where a note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placed below the higher line is distinct from a note placed above the lower line. Hidden staff lines are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"included when specifying clef lines and determining display-step \/ display-octave values, but are not counted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as lines for the purposes of the system-layout and staff-layout elements."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxllinedetail","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLLineDetail","role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLStaffDetails/Group-swift.struct":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Group","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLStaffDetails.Group","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Group","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of lines on the staff, and per-line appearance details, for non-5-line staves."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlstaffdetails\/group-swift.struct","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffDetails\/Group-swift.struct","role":"symbol"}}}